1
00:00:00,247 --> 00:00:00,875
Hah...

2
00:00:01,130 --> 00:00:03,192
kayaknya gue mulai pilek nih.

3
00:00:03,590 --> 00:00:04,543
Tapi santai.

4
00:00:04,914 --> 00:00:06,910
Warna udah beres,
tinggal pilih font.

5
00:00:07,312 --> 00:00:09,842
Lah, kok poster gue malah
kayak undangan nikahan?

6
00:00:10,240 --> 00:00:12,841
Awalnya gue cuma pengen
desainnya kelihatan keren.

7
00:00:13,240 --> 00:00:14,916
Judul pakai font dekoratif,

8
00:00:15,207 --> 00:00:16,557
diskon pakai font tebel,

9
00:00:16,837 --> 00:00:18,670
informasi kecil beda font lagi.

10
00:00:19,070 --> 00:00:19,732
Buset.

11
00:00:20,130 --> 00:00:22,432
Ini poster promo apa
reuni keluarga font?

12
00:00:22,830 --> 00:00:24,220
Judulnya susah dibaca.

13
00:00:24,620 --> 00:00:26,022
Diskonnya malah kalah mencolok.

14
00:00:26,420 --> 00:00:27,882
Udah kayak undangan kondangan,

15
00:00:28,280 --> 00:00:29,745
tinggal tambahin nama pengantinnya.

16
00:00:30,130 --> 00:00:30,642
Hah...

17
00:00:30,960 --> 00:00:32,320
oke, fokus, fokus.

18
00:00:32,720 --> 00:00:34,322
Gue pakai satu keluarga font,

19
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:36,591
terus mainin ketebalan
sama ukurannya.

20
00:00:36,990 --> 00:00:38,140
Judul harus tegas.

21
00:00:38,540 --> 00:00:39,800
Angka diskon paling besar.

22
00:00:40,200 --> 00:00:41,450
Info kecil tetap kebaca.

23
00:00:41,850 --> 00:00:43,800
Gue rapihin jarak
dan susunan teksnya.

24
00:00:44,200 --> 00:00:46,722
Nah, sekarang
posternya enak dilihat.

25
00:00:47,120 --> 00:00:48,320
Promonya langsung kelihatan.

26
00:00:48,723 --> 00:00:49,920
Oke, kirim ke klien.

27
00:00:50,321 --> 00:00:51,500
Eh, langsung dibales?

28
00:00:51,900 --> 00:00:53,982
Bagus sih, tapi kurang nendang.

29
00:00:54,376 --> 00:00:56,170
Haduh, revisi lagi.

30
00:00:56,573 --> 00:00:59,106
Episode lima, perang
sama revisi klien.
